{
  "dn23:2.8": "saṅghasaṅghīgaṇībhūtā → sī. saṅghāsaṅghīgaṇībhūtā. | sīsapāvanaṃ → ito paraṃ sīhalapotthake tenupasaṅkamantīti dissati.",
  "dn23:3.2": "gacchante → ito paraṃ sīhalapotthake tenupasaṅkamanteti dissati.",
  "dn23:7.5": "vadehīti → sī. paṇehīti.",
  "dn23:7.7": "kāretvā → sī. karitvā.",
  "dn23:9.26": "sunhātassa → sunahātassātipi pāṭho.",
  "dn23:11.42": "paṭisevanti → sī. ito paraṃ appasaddāni appanigghosānīti dissati.",
  "dn23:12.12": "dukkhapaṭikūlā → yu. ito paraṃ attānaṃ na mārentītipi pāṭho.",
  "dn23:13.6": "mātusapatiṃ → mātusapattinti vā pāṭho.",
  "dn23:13.9": "santako → sī. ayaṃ na dissati.",
  "dn23:14.10": "bahalavilepanaṃ → sī. bahalāvalepanaṃ.",
  "dn23:18.23": "leṇḍunā → leḍḍunātipi pāṭho.",
  "dn23:19.5": "manussānaṃ → sī. paccantajānaṃ manussānaṃ.",
  "dn23:21.3": "sammati → sī. vasati.",
  "dn23:21.4": "satthavāso → sī. janapadapadeso.",
  "dn23:21.30": "vīsatidhā → sī satadhā.",
  "dn23:23.4": "haritakapaṇṇaṃ → sī. haritakavantaṃ.",
  "dn23:23.36": "sesāni → sī. sesesi.",
  "dn23:25.6": "bhakkho → sī. mamañca sūkarabhatto.",
  "dn23:25.12": "hariyissasīti → harissasīti pāṭhena bhavitabbaṃ.",
  "dn23:27.6": "pajoharissāmīti → a. evaṃ pajohissāmītīti pana pāṭhena bhavitabbaṃ.",
  "dn23:31.3": "dubbhumme → dubbhūmeti vā pāṭho.",
  "dn23:32.2": "kāṇājikaṃ → kajhājakanti vā pāṭho.",
  "dn23:32.3": "vāvaṭo → sī. vyāvaṭo.",
  "dn23:32.20": "pāyāsirājaññassa → pāyāsissa rājaññassāti pāṭhena bhavitabbaṃ.",
  "dn23:32.22": "apaviṭṭhaṃ → sī. apaviddhaṃ.",
  "dn23:35.4": "sakkapañhakaṃ → sī. sakkameva ca.",
  "dn23:35.7": "vuccatīti → sī. mahāvaggassa saṅgaho."
